{"server":"cn","storyId":"act13side_level_act13side_05_end","groupId":"act13side","stageId":"act13side_05","title":"人言可畏","storyCode":"NL-5","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act13side/level_act13side_05_end.txt","sourceHash":"10c34d9b04146b2db7b0629a18524d67016d7233c16dacb561187c7a04d780e1","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"遭到了无胄盟威胁的临光不得不谨慎起来，而目睹了玄铁威势的青金罗伊也坦然了一段关于白金的过去。感染者骑士们已经蓄势待发，他们打算瘫痪整座城市。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"卡西米尔2 5-2"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......之前我还奇怪，为什么你们要带着那个路都走不了的萨卡兹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......莫妮克阁下，我怎么什么都没感觉到......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那就少说话，少丢脸。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......无胄盟吗，有何贵干？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首先，请允许我向耀骑士道歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"关于今天无胄盟绑架了玛莉娅一事——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——喔，别冲动，再说也不是我干的啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你们......卑劣的刽子手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛莉娅此时应该已经安全回家了，放心，没有后续针对你们的行动，就算有，也会尽量做得......不那么完美。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无胄盟也只是收钱办事，就算我们不想，毕竟上面的人也盯着，你说对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......你们在袭击感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这也是上面的安排，别怪我们啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恶行不因为其缘由而洗刷罪孽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......说的也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我们今天这不是来打声招呼吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们没什么好聊的，要动手的话，随时奉陪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是咄咄逼人，直说了吧，我们想摆脱商业联合会的控制。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天来，我就是想把这话挑明的。我们是对立的立场，毕竟现在我们还是联合会的人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我们是否可以私下签订一份和平协议呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耀骑士","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你，耀骑士，临光家族和那些附庸，以及“罗德岛”。我们希望你们不要影响到我们的计划。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相对的，无胄盟不会妨碍你的夺冠，更不会对和耀骑士相关的人物出手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜莺","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"......那些感染者呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......遗憾，我们也不能做到所有事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者对我们而言也算是个威胁，但是请放心，现在的我们也需要那些感染者骑士——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当你们的替罪者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是我索求的东西，无胄盟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——无胄盟是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"古时候，为了对抗荒淫无道的骑士贵族，当地的农民和扈从们串通，雇佣了一批身经百战的杀手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是他们——全都失手了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"骑士把叛徒通通吊死，悬挂在城堡之上，以儆效尤。领地内的村民怒不敢言，只能忍气吞声，放弃抵抗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过后来，有一位弓手主动请缨，当时人们普遍认为弓箭手无法应对库兰塔骑士的速度，并不抱期望......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然而翌日清晨，那位暴虐骑士的家人们醒来后，却看见那位骑士保持着冲锋的姿势，仰面朝天，被一杆长枪钉在了广场地面——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等到人们靠近细看，才发现那并不是一杆长枪，而是一支利箭，由玄铁铸造而成的利箭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“玄铁”，是历史上第一位无胄盟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然我对于我们只是被雇来的杀手这点还是有自觉的，不过呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有些传说，可不是空穴来风。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"——临光！上面！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"耀骑士抬起头。\n路灯暗淡，今夜星光璀璨。\n而其中一颗流星，闪烁了数下之后，偏离了群星的轨道。\n直坠大地。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——箭！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"斩断它！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明白——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜莺","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"咿呀——！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"丽兹，小心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"（临光和我同时出剑......竟然，都没能砍断？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没事吧，二位？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜莺","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"没、没事......刚、刚才那是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"玛嘉烈沉默地望向一旁。\n漆黑的箭矢，如长矛般的箭矢，没入水泥地面之中，悄无声息。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"了不起......能反应过来还挡开玄铁一箭的人，我还是头一次见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"耀骑士的剑术果然了得，那边那位赦罪师，也让人看到了一些别开生面的技巧......幸好箭矢是没有生命的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——那是灵魂的味道吗？萨卡兹？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这个医师的剑术和法术......究竟到了什么地步？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"少说废话......这就是你们所谓的，停战协议吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们心里清楚，这一箭并非冲着取你们的性命去的。否则，那边那位坐着的萨卡兹......已经死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜莺","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"招呼就到此为止，各位，请认真考虑一下我们的提议。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......还有，希望刚才那箭能让你们明白，无胄盟并非在向你们求饶——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“玄铁”有三位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们能挡下几箭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"慢着！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"两位无胄盟的身影溶解在了霓虹与月光的间隙中。\n耳边只剩下爵士乐的声响。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......“玄铁”，有着黑曜石般光泽的金属，很重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"就如其名......像是从......天上落下的一般。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜莺","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"天......上？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......天上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"耀骑士再次看向天空。\n群星在此刻仿佛杀机四伏。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这支箭......从很远的地方射出，极高的抛物线让它变得仿佛从天而降。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"这不合常理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......无胄盟，“玄铁”大位，如那个油嘴滑舌的男人所说，他们才是“无胄盟”一词的原典。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样的杀手，此刻，也许正盯着我们的项上人头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"我们确实得警惕一些。这里是卡西米尔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"是他们罪行的堡垒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G03"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......马克维茨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了吗？麦基先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......总觉得你这两天变得轻快了许多，发生什么了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......只是找到了自己该做的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该做的事情吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听说，你和罗德岛制药的关系十分密切，前些日子，还安排了他们的领导人与其他几家企业的会晤？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是这样没错......怎么了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也知道，感染者的舆论压力越来越大，我们总要做出一些反应。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛是零号地块为数不多的境外企业，但也是得到监正会大力支持的企业。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们需要认真对待罗德岛。实际上，今天几位常务董事已经明示，要我们调查......并处理罗德岛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"处......理吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"零号地块有一些秘密，是不能让外人知道的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这件事直接动用了无胄盟，“白金”大位的指挥权也会再次让渡给此事的负责人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......连无胄盟都......！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过......我向董事会提议，把这件事的负责人变更成了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！麦基先生！感谢您！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是希望你和罗德岛的私交，能让这件事变得简单一些。在卡西米尔做生意，总得按卡西米尔的规矩来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......还有一件事。这件事请绝对不要声张，否则会很危险。虽然目前白金及大部分无胄盟还在管控之内。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但无胄盟内部出了问题，大问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G09"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您又在发呆了吗？感到无聊吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最近的大骑士领，有很多人开始抵制感染者骑士......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不是这样的话，嘻......我倒是愿意陪您稍微逛一逛呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"比起我，阿米娅她们承受着更大的压力。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是这样......当然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我时常在想，你们这些人，来卡西米尔的目的......究竟是什么呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"可露希尔总是抱怨财政赤字，总得想想办法。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"临光也说，卡西米尔还有等待被拯救的人们。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我问过她，她打算怎么做。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"得到答案之后，我决定支持她。阿米娅也是。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"所以我们来了。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不算太意外的答案呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然在过去，我只会觉得这是冠冕堂皇的借口......耀骑士在罗德岛的地位很高吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我还真没考虑过“地位”这个问题。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......听说现代的卡西米尔企业也流行鼓吹扁平化管理，但其实只是让底层劳动者放松警惕的由头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，如果博士您这么说......我就当是吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是不是意味着，如果我也去罗德岛兼职的话，能和您......平起平坐呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]},{"label":"我很尊敬临光小姐，与地位无关。","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，真让人羡慕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是排除了身份与地位，单纯将耀骑士作为一个“人”来看待......还尊敬着她吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛的其他人......会得到您这样的尊敬吗？如果会的话，我倒是有些好奇呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]},{"label":"玛嘉烈·临光是我们的干员，我并没有把她当做耀骑士。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有很多骑士都尊敬着耀骑士。不过，原因无非两种。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要么因为，她是“临光”，要么因为，她是“耀骑士”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能听到别的答案，对一个卡西米尔的骑士而言，可真是一件新鲜事。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是被贩卖到卡西米尔来的，从那时候起，我就被老爷教育，要时刻准备好为他人献身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕此刻，我也会为了您而死哦？嘻嘻。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"因为我是你的护卫目标？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"因为监正院的命令？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......所谓的征战骑士，就是这么被训练的啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，耀骑士的行为，在我看来，有些渺茫，有些遥远。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您觉得，为他人的理想献身，是一件伟大的事情吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"当然。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"是的。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那如果这个人的理想也是为了他人献身，最后，我们又得到了什么呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"得到了一片更加美好的大地。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"哪怕只美好了一丁点。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天真的想法，这可和您在商业联合会面前机敏的表现大不相符......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"对了，砾小姐。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您请说。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"如果你觉得我不值得你牺牲，就别这么做。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......怎么可以说这种话，您在质疑我的忠——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"如果你觉得我值得你牺牲，那就为了我们活下去。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"您只是一名优秀的骑士，罗德岛的合伙人。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"您是自由的。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G07"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在想什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，只是......很久没见过玄铁出手了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上一次是什么时候？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你还没升到青金这个位置......处决上一任白金的时候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那时候的白金大位是欣特莱雅的师父......差不多这个意思吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那天下着雨，下午四点四十七，本来，我正打算出差去一趟别的城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那时候的青金只有我一个人，我突然接到电话，说是“白金”叛逃了，要立刻去处理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......然后呢，你亲手杀死了你的同事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。如果真那样的话，恐怕我晚上做梦会觉得不安的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实等我们匆匆赶到现场的时候......哈哈。那是一栋烂尾楼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"整个三楼面目全非，叛徒......被高高地钉在一堵墙上，胸口插着一支玄铁重箭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从我不太专业的现场勘探技巧来判断......“白金”曾试图逃离那里，却在半空中被那支重箭横穿胸口，钉入了墙壁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我当时就在那堵墙的下面。那个爱上目标而试图背叛我们的可怜人，就那么被钉在上面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就记得，那堵墙很白。他的死状就像是受难者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有见识太少的傻子才会被嚷嚷着自由与理想的家伙骗到。他们根本不理解生存的本质是什么。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......他们终于打算行动了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......红松骑士团吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，他们非常谨慎，不过现在......他们终于按捺不住了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟这两天连抵制感染者的游行都出现了呢......真滑稽啊，我都搞不清谁才是受害者了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，怎么又是电话，真麻烦啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电话那头的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"为什么没有按照坐标移动？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电话那头的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"否则，赦罪师和耀骑士没有机会拦下那一箭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电话那头的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你让他们面朝北方，提前看见了我的箭矢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电话那头的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"否则，至少，那个坐在椅子上的萨卡兹必死无疑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈，不知道您在说什么——就算打哈哈也没用吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我临时的判断，老板，对于耀骑士这种不撞南墙不回头的人来说，杀掉一个，只会激化她的行为。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电话那头的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"若能让耀骑士失去理智，也未尝不可。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这太危险了，老板。原谅我先斩后奏，但我觉得，现在的威胁恰到好处，过犹不及。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相信我，耀骑士不会妨碍您的计划......说起来，我能问问现在事情怎么样了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电话那头的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......董事会很快就会察觉到。但是没关系，等到感染者们让这座城市瘫痪的时候......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电话那头的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我会亲自解决最后几个接线人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电话那头的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"从今往后，将不再有人，知晓无胄盟高层的真面目。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......就位。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_kxstreet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亚克","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听得见。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G07"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"准备就绪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_221","isRemote":false,"text":"哦！我们能做到的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"......索娜。恢复备用电源的速度很快，我们不知道他们是不是有改进过的应急措施。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"千万......千万不要掉以轻心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，那我是要继续闹点大动静了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"走啊，野鬃，把那些无胄盟的脑袋都打烂！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，随时可以出发。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G04"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......艾沃娜会正面袭击无胄盟的巡逻小队。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"半小时后，小灰突袭能源区。不出意外的话，监正会的守卫应该会被“撤走”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"我会潜入联合会大楼，拿走我们需要的，轻轻松松。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......那么，开始行动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托兰","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我可以帮你混进大楼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托兰","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在这之后，我就帮不上你了，而且也要有人确保道路通畅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"已经够了，谢啦，托兰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托兰","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别忘了我对你说的，你们在做的事情，有着超乎你们自己想象的意义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托兰","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让所有人都见证一下吧，见证一座城市的恸哭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_147_shining","aliases":["闪灵"]},{"speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","aliases":["夜莺"]}]}
